        "original_id": "82aa5c0c-712e-527b-a2f1-5ebc700646ba",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams/Franchises: Philadelphia 76ers\n- People: Joel Embiid, Sam Hinkie\n- Organizations/Leagues: National Basketball Association\n- Events/Seasons: 2015–16 Philadelphia 76ers season, 2014 NBA draft\n- Concepts/Nicknames: “The Process”, “trust the process”\n\nFacts:\n- The 2014 NBA draft was the draft in which Joel Embiid was selected with the third pick.\n- The 2015–16 Philadelphia 76ers season was the 77th season of the Philadelphia 76ers franchise in the National Basketball Association.\n- During the 2015–16 Philadelphia 76ers season, Joel Embiid did not suit up for the Philadelphia 76ers because of a leg injury for the second straight season.\n- Joel Embiid nicknamed himself “The Process” in response to Philadelphia 76ers fans repeating “trust the process” during the Sam Hinkie era.",
